My helper:
```
lemma setIntegral_eq_integral_of_support {s : Set (Vec d)} (hs : MeasurableSet s) {f : Vec d → ℝ}
    (hsupp : ∀ y, f y ≠ 0 → y ∈ s) (μ : Measure (Vec d)) :
    ∫ y in s, f y ∂μ = ∫ y, f y ∂μ := by
  rw [← integral_indicator hs]
  apply integral_congr_ae
  filter_upwards with y
  by_cases hy : y ∈ s
  · simp [Set.indicator_of_mem hy]
  · have h0 : f y = 0 := by
      by_contra h
      exact hy (hsupp y h)
    simp [Set.indicator_of_not_mem hy, h0]
```
Note `integral_indicator hs : ∫ x, indicator s f x ∂μ = ∫ x in s, f x ∂μ`, so `rw [← integral_indicator hs]` changes `∫ y in s, f y ∂μ` into `∫ y, indicator s f y ∂μ` ✓. Then congr_ae.

